Codex Reset Card Desktop is an independent Windows desktop companion for:
https://github.com/loccen/codex-reset-card

Tested upstream version: 0.2.0
Inspected upstream commit: b29aa8d7ee09d48ebe2686368c441ba73f61d2e4

The desktop UI, notifications and per-card postponement adapter are maintained
separately from the original scheduler. The adapter follows that scheduler's
state schema and Windows singleton protocol. Upstream copyright and MIT terms
are retained in LICENSES/codex-reset-card.MIT.

This project is not an official OpenAI product and is not affiliated with OpenAI.